<title>FRANCE: Galeries Lafayette nine month sales slip.</title>
<headline>Galeries Lafayette nine month sales slip.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					20,145    vs   20,517</p>
<p>    -- of which third quarter		  6,462    vs    6,689</p>
<p>NOTE - Retailer Galeries Lafayette gave the figures in the BALO official bulletin.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
